    "summary": "Your **WARBIKERS** units get **BATTLELINE**.\n\nWhenever a **SPEED FREEKS** unit of yours is picked for an [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back):\n\n- its ranged attacks get **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** for the rest of the turn\n- it is not made ineligible to [declare a charge](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) by that move",
